Version 1.04a (October 1, 2026)
-------------------------------
* Converted to native nftables for Arno's (NFT) Firewall (rules in table inet anf)
* Rules are no longer removed when stopping, (re)start and stop replace the whole ruleset atomically
* Load the nf_nat module only (no ip_nat fallback)

Version 1.04 (July 31, 2015)
--------------------------------
* Use modprobe_multi for newer kernels

Version 1.03 (September 19, 2010)
--------------------------------
* Changed to be IPv4-only

Version 1.02 (September 8, 2008)
--------------------------------
! Fixed incorrect configuration filename

Version 1.01 (September 4, 2008)
------------------------------------
! Fixed accidental DOS formating of the plugin

Version 1.0 (August 9, 2008)
------------------------------------
